[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 2. Core Architecture Principles[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m1. **Maintain Prediction Contract Integrity:**[m
[32m+[m[32m   - The ML service endpoint `POST /predict` accepts time-series student observations and returns risks/intervention suggestions.[m
[32m+[m[32m   - Do not break, rename, or arbitrarily alter schemas in `app/schemas.py` or prediction logic in `app/predictor.py`.[m
[32m+[m[32m2. **BHASHINI OCR Integration:**[m
[32m+[m[32m   - External service uses the verified endpoint:[m
[32m+[m[32m     `https://dhruva-api.bhashini.gov.in/services/inference/pipeline`[m
[32m+[m[32m   - Active working service ID: `bhashini/bodhan/indic-doc/ocr`.[m
[32m+[m[32m   - Never hardcode API keys or print them in logs, error payloads, or markdown files.[m
[32m+[m[32m   - External requests must always specify finite timeouts (default 60s).[m
[32m+[m[32m   - Upstream service failures return a clean HTTP 502 with sanitized descriptions.[m
[32m+[m[32m3. **Dynamic Student Document Parsing:**[m
[32m+[m[32m   - Never assume fixed layouts, uniform school names, or fixed subject lists.[m
[32m+[m[32m   - Always extract text dynamically, preserve raw OCR output, and identify ambiguous or unparsed fields for human review.[m
[32m+[m[32m   - Never fabricate roll numbers, student names, marks, or attendance data.[m
[32m+[m[32m4. **Data Persistence & Local Storage:**[m
[32m+[m[32m   - Use lightweight, local, maintainable storage (SQLite / JSON storage) with unique document identifiers and duplicate detection.[m
[32m+[m[32m   - Never silently overwrite records belonging to another student.[m
[32m+[m[32m5. **Testing & Quality Assurance:**[m
